('site_036', 'gate', '180,1010,480;1040,1010,470;1900,1010,490;220,700,500;1860,680,530;700,430,1180;950,790,630', 'Segmented eel contacts', 'valve,pipe,gauge,buoy,crate,sign', 'Parallel wet lanes stop at dry gate plinths. Raised contacts, maintenance stairs and a fixed overhead gantry always leave a route outside an electric pulse.'),
